  <h2>1. Overview</h2>
  <p>We stand behind the quality of our Course. We believe that if you apply the strategies and techniques taught in the Course with genuine effort, you will see meaningful improvements in your daily habits. For this reason, we offer a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>: an unconditional cooling-off refund during the first 7 days, and a conditional money-back guarantee through day 30 to ensure you have a fair opportunity to implement the Course material.</p>

  <h2>2. Eligibility for a Refund</h2>
  <p>Refunds of the actual amount you paid for the Course are available within <strong>30 calendar days</strong> of the original purchase date, in two tiers:</p>

  <h3>2.1 Days 1-7: Cooling-Off Refund (no conditions)</h3>
  <p>If your refund request is submitted within <strong>7 calendar days</strong> of the original purchase date, we will issue a full refund of the amount you paid - no questions asked and no documentation required.</p>

  <h3>2.2 Days 8-30: Implementation-Based Refund</h3>
  <p>If your refund request is submitted between <strong>day 8 and day 30</strong> after the original purchase date, we require evidence that you have made a genuine good-faith effort to implement the Course recommendations - the Course is designed to produce results through active participation and consistent application. This means:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>You must have actively used the Sleep Diary for a minimum of <strong>14 consecutive days</strong></li>
    <li>You must provide documentation of your Sleep Diary use (see Section 2.3)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2.3 What Qualifies as Proof of Implementation</h3>
  <p>Acceptable documentation includes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Screenshots or photographs of your completed Sleep Diary</strong> showing at least 14 consecutive days of entries (whether maintained using the provided template on paper, in a personal spreadsheet, or in any other format)</li>
    <li><strong>A digital copy of your Sleep Diary</strong> (e.g., a completed spreadsheet based on our provided template)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The purpose of this requirement is not to create obstacles to a legitimate refund, but to ensure that you have given the Course a fair opportunity to work. We believe in the effectiveness of the program when followed as directed.</p>

  <h3>2.4 After Day 30</h3>
  <p>Refund requests submitted more than 30 calendar days after the original purchase date are not eligible for a refund (see Section 7).</p>

  <h2>3. How to Request a Refund</h2>
  <p>To initiate a refund request:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Send an email to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.refunds }}">{{ site.email.refunds }}</a> with the subject line "Refund Request - [Your Name]"</li>
    <li>Include your full name and the email address used for purchase</li>
    <li>Include your order number or the Stripe receipt number from your purchase confirmation email</li>
    <li>If your request is submitted after day 7, attach your proof of implementation as described in Section 2.3</li>
    <li>Briefly describe what you found was not working or where you encountered difficulties</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>4. Refund Amount</h2>
  <p>Refunds are issued for the <strong>actual amount you paid</strong> for the Course. If you purchased the Course using a promotional discount, coupon, or special offer, the refund will reflect the discounted price you paid, not the standard listed price.</p>

  <h2>5. Refund Processing</h2>

  <h3>5.1 Review</h3>
  <p>Upon receiving your refund request with all required documentation, our team will review your submission within <strong>5 business days</strong>. We may contact you for clarification or to offer additional support before processing the refund.</p>

  <h3>5.2 Approval and Processing</h3>
  {# DIMA: Paddle -> Stripe (мы продавец, рефанды инициируем сами через Stripe). #}
  <p>If your refund request meets all eligibility criteria, we will initiate a full refund of the amount you paid. Refunds are processed through Stripe, our payment processor, and issued to the original payment method used for purchase. Processing times may vary depending on your bank or payment provider (typically 5-10 business days).</p>

  <h2>6. What Happens After a Refund</h2>
  <p>Upon approval and processing of a refund:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your access to the Course on Systeme.io and all related materials will be revoked</li>
    <li>Your license to use any downloaded materials is terminated</li>
    <li>You must delete any Course materials you may have saved locally</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
  <p>Refunds will <strong>not</strong> be granted in the following cases:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The refund request is submitted more than 30 calendar days after the original purchase date</li>
    <li>For requests submitted after day 7: no proof of implementation is provided, or the proof does not meet the requirements of Section 2.3</li>
    <li>The purchaser has previously received a refund for the same or a substantially similar product from us</li>
    <li>There is evidence of account sharing, content piracy, or violation of our Terms of Service</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>8. Disputes and Chargebacks</h2>
  <p>We strongly encourage you to contact us directly before initiating a chargeback or dispute with your bank or payment provider. We are committed to resolving issues fairly and promptly. Initiating a chargeback without first contacting us may result in permanent suspension from all of our Services.</p>
  <p>Please note that chargeback disputes are handled through your bank and our payment processor (Stripe). We respond to and cooperate fully in resolving any such disputes.</p>

  <h2>9. Our Commitment</h2>
  <p>If your refund request is denied because the proof of implementation requirements were not met, but you are willing to continue the program, we may at our discretion extend your refund eligibility window by an additional 15 days to allow you more time to complete the required steps. This is offered as a good-faith effort to support your success.</p>

  <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>For refund-related questions or to submit a refund request, contact us at:</p>
  <p>
    <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.refunds }}">{{ site.email.refunds }}</a><br>
    <strong>Response time:</strong> We aim to respond to all refund-related inquiries within 2 business days.
  </p>
  <p>For billing or payment method questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.refunds }}">{{ site.email.refunds }}</a> - payment processing is handled by Stripe, but all customer support goes through us.</p>

